{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1496.unity3d","item_key":"commands[1].text","source_sha256":"ccd99f8f2c7f50c07f3df65af8a7b93395a695e74d2fb7272416b765891b0e9e","ja":"不穏な空気","zh":"不祥的气氛","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1496.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"beb2f5d86c081d1bad0863ee4b5c87c54d6b1e2972fea5fc500a315d397de216","ja":"春香たち4人は、PV撮影のため、\n夜の山に来ていて……","zh":"春香等4人为了拍摄MV，\n来到了夜晚的山里……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1496.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"bb39a7622f4948062b5b139e6ca2c73436eaed47cde2d77882cc9f7a3e014425","ja":"わぁ～……星が、すっごくくっきり見えますよ！\n頑張って登ったかいがありますね！","zh":"哇～……星星看得好清楚啊！\n真不枉我们努力爬上来了呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1496.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"acdd4744a4e6bc8d86b205b278ab63fa64377b7bdd66b85a261784246aaaf6cf","ja":"真に……。\n満天の星空とは、まさにこのことかと。","zh":"确实……\n所谓的满天繁星，想必正是指这般景象吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1496.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"7ed5c2fb26b90387560b67f952a9c1e021d907261ec3654cf73c9fb4af0c3879","ja":"なんでわざわざ山に、って思ってたけど、\nこれを見ちゃうと納得ね。","zh":"之前还在想为什么要特意跑到山里来，\n不过看到这幅景象就能理解了呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1496.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"8fa98e51f83a9a46951855179a3d55a3751b7dc4d0a2cf1d438dd661016c7a14","ja":"うん。あとは、準備が終わるのを\n待つだけだけど……。","zh":"嗯。接下来只要等准备工作结束\n就行了，不过……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1496.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"4253ca82999d04bd74cda8d329446e3ed37ca5f0fbfcb0bf217ba7bf3bc6cd0e","ja":"「大変です！　ライト用のケーブルが破損してます！\n予備ってどこにありますか！？」","zh":"“不好了！照明用的线缆破损了！\n备用的放在哪里！？”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1496.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"225220e68fab4bf754dda5f1085c5e9bf695b738d2cafd22195362056ce93312","ja":"「い、急いで確認してくるわ！\nあなたは先にあっちを手伝って！」","zh":"“我、我这就去确认！\n你先去那边帮忙吧！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1496.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"76b9f9104a08118eb7aaf449ceed8ad389a513195f66907450bbad2b93f1950e","ja":"……スタッフさん、みんなバタバタしてるね。","zh":"……工作人员们全都忙忙碌碌的呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1496.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"c14b32710ad6e9b0697c7f0ec945a421efd42a28bde7e3caffc651b34791eb1e","ja":"機材トラブルみたい。ここじゃ故障しても、\n予備は限られてるし、大変なんじゃないかしら？","zh":"好像是器材出了故障。在这里就算坏了，\n备用设备也有限，处理起来会很不容易吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1496.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"227a8d9ec02ba1254c9f6329837713d43bb058223edf14811d4179ad5232be7c","ja":"「電源が入らない……！？　登山前のテストでは、\nちゃんとついてたのに……くそっ！」","zh":"“开不了机……！？登山前测试的时候，\n明明还能正常开机的……可恶！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1496.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"733417560d46012b3cab816d1313d0bad1e66be3bc039ea7246998954c7b5131","ja":"な、なんだかちょっと、\n殺気立ってるみたい……？","zh":"总、总觉得好像有点\n杀气腾腾的样子……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1496.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"fba13c734dd10160b2112c52a4ad650fdc5c8c0bcd2223d48ea76750423a737d","ja":"そうですね……一度、落ち着いていただいた方が\n良いかと。何か良い方法があれば……？","zh":"是啊……我想最好能\n先让她冷静一下。要是能有什么好办法的话……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1496.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"fbfd3ee6f5556e9581e5a89b930f899e7d95b7852f83481ca07a77df10754191","ja":"……あ！　それなら私、いいの持ってるよ♪","zh":"……啊！　要是那样的话，我有好东西哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
